      "name": "@local/contract-sure",
      "title": { "en": "Contract Sure", "zh": "履约无忧" },
      "description": {
        "en": "Connects to the Contract Sure compliance system through browser authorization (multiple accounts, revocable): contract PDF/scan recognition with verification cards, transaction reconciliation, dashboard trends and original document preview, plus 5 built-in skills (contract import and risk analysis, payment follow-up, reconciliation, monthly report, risk review). Requires a Contract Sure server that supports plugin authorization.",
        "zh": "通过浏览器授权连接履约无忧合同履约系统（支持多账户、可吊销），提供合同 PDF/扫描件识别核对卡、三流流水对账、履约看板趋势与原件预览，内置导入分析合同、回款跟进、三流核对、履约月报、风险排查 5 个 skill；需履约系统升级到支持插件授权的版本。"
