    {
      "name": "@local/salesforge",
      "title": { "en": "SalesForge", "zh": "销售管理" },
      "description": {
        "en": "Connects to the SalesForge sales management system through browser authorization (multiple accounts, revocable): look up and maintain customers, channels, projects, daily/weekly reports and sales targets in chat. Creates and edits are written as you; deletions and owner transfers wait for you to confirm on a card. Daily reports keep your own words, fixing only typos. 6 built-in skills (data lookup, data editing, project analysis, target tracking, customer follow-up, weekly review). Requires a SalesForge server that lets plugins maintain business data.",
        "zh": "通过浏览器授权连接 SalesForge 销售管理系统（支持多账户、可吊销），在对话里查询和维护客户、渠道、项目、日报周报和销售目标：新建和修改以你的名义直接写入，删除和移交负责人先在卡片上由你确认；写日报照你的原话，只改错别字。内置查数据、维护数据、项目分析、目标追踪、客户跟进、周报复盘 6 个 skill；需销售管理系统升级到允许插件维护业务数据的版本。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/salesforge.svg",
      "author": "Shanzhi Digital",
      "homepage": "https://gitee.com/groundhogtang/shanzhi-plugin/tree/2198ed52818d57ed499630516fd641cabfd92d09/plugins/salesforge",
