    {
      "name": "@local/echomind",
      "title": { "en": "EchoMind Meeting Minutes", "zh": "EchoMind 会议纪要" },
      "description": {
        "en": "Connects to EchoMind via Feishu browser authorization (multiple accounts, revocable): local dual-track real-time recording, offline speech transcription and speaker voiceprint recognition, evidence-grounded meeting minutes and dual-track audio playback, todo confirmation cards for Feishu tasks, and DataHub meeting-minutes knowledge base sync. 5 built-in skills (live meeting, review and push, search and trace, import audio, cross-system follow-up). Requires native capture/transcribe components and local offline speech models.",
        "zh": "通过飞书浏览器授权连接 EchoMind（支持多账户、可吊销），提供本机双轨实时录音、离线语音转写与声纹识别、带出处结构化纪要与时间轴双轨原声回放、待办确认卡片推送飞书任务及 DataHub 会议纪要知识库同步；内置实时会议、纪要审阅推飞书、原话检索溯源、外部音频导入、跨系统跟进 5 个 skill；首次使用需就绪本机录音/转写组件与离线语音模型。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/echomind.svg",
      "author": "Shanzhi Digital",
